export anchor DarkTonalStyle:
    number: 245
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark tonal
    idea: Panels float as rounded cards separated by steps of tone instead of lines, so the editor reads as soft layered surfaces with one lavender accent.
    base: dark
    palette:
        tone0: #0e1012, the page and the canvas
        tone1: #17191d, the floating header, layers and inspector cards
        tone2: #202328, inspector groups, the tool rail, layer tiles and status chips
        tone3: #2a2e35, fields and secondary buttons
        tone4: #363b44, hover and the active direction segment
        ink: #e6e8ec, text
        muted: #a3a9b3, labels, secondary lines and idle icons
        lavender: #c6b8ff, the primary button, the active tool, the frame selection and focus
        lavenderInk: #191431, text and icons on lavender
        tint: #2c2843, the selected layer row and the frame name pill
        saved: #7ed6a7, the Saved chip text and icon
        pin: #ffc98a, the comment pin
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 13px at 1.45. Names 13px 600, muted labels 12px 600,
        second lines in layer rows 12px muted, values with tabular numbers,
        and the style sheet title 26px 700.
    layout:
        Everything floats inside an 8px gutter on tone0. A 56px header card
        holds a lavender rounded B tile, the crumb Website redesign slash
        Home v3, three rounded square initials tiles, a zoom chip with a
        magnifier, Present and a lavender Share. Below sit three cards, a
        256px layers card, the canvas and a 272px inspector card. Layer rows
        are 10px rounded with a 26px tonal icon tile, two lines for Headline
        and Primary button, a lavender Selected chip on Hero and a muted
        Collapsed note on Features. A vertical tool rail floats at the left
        edge of the canvas in tone2 with 44px tools, Move filled lavender.
        The status sits as three chips at the bottom of the canvas. The
        inspector stacks tone2 groups for Position and size, Fill, Auto
        layout with a two way segment, Corner radius and Export, each with
        34px tone3 pill fields. Below 760px the side cards hide, the rail
        turns horizontal and floats above the status chips.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 8px gutters between cards, 12px card padding, 6px between fields.
    density: Medium. 34 to 44px targets and two line layer rows.
    corners: Generous. 14px cards, 10 to 12px groups, buttons and rows, 8px fields, round handles.
    borders: None anywhere. Every edge is a step between the five tones.
    shadows: None on panels. Only the comment bubble lifts with 0 8px 24px black at 45 percent.
    icons:
        18px line icons at 1.8px stroke inside 26px tonal tiles, which turn
        lavender on the selected row. Saved uses a check circle, editing two
        people and the version a tag, each beside its words.
    focus: A 2px lavender ring offset 2px, an inset 2px lavender ring on fields.
    tone: Friendly plain labels, such as Position and size.
